\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1. (ff. 1r-58r) <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Angelus Politianus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >, Exzerpte aus der Suda mit eigenen lat. Paraphrasen (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ex Suda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), vgl. A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Adler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Hrsg.), Suidae Lexicon, I\endash IV (Lexicographi Graeci I, 1-4), Leipzig 1928-1935 (Ndr. Stuttgart 1989-1994). \endash  (f. 1r) Prooemium; inc.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Librum Suda vocatum composuerunt Eudemus rhetor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u8051 ?\u958 \'ee\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Helladius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u8051 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8001 ?\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\u8016 ?\u947 \'e3\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u8016 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u969 \'f9\u947 \'e3\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Adler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , I, S. <1>, 2-15. \endash  (ff. 1r-12r) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; erstes Lemma: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u946 \'e2\u946 \'e2\u8118 ?\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8053 ?\u961 \'f1.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est inter ceteros Deus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8166 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u965 \'f5\u7985 ?\u959 \'ef\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u966 \'f6\u8127 ?\u959 \'ef\u8023 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2\u8060 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Adler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , I, S. <2>, 21 u. S. 3, 6-10. \endash  (ff. 12r-13v) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u914 \'c2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 13v-15r) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u915 \'c3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 15r-19r) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u916 \'c4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 19r-20r) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u921 \'c9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 20r-26r) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (f. 26r-v) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u918 \'c6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 26v-27r) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\u921 \'c9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 27v-28r) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u919 \'c7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 28r-30r) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 30r-31r) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u921 \'c9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 31r-34v) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 34v-36r) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u923 \'cb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 36v-39r) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 39r-40r) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u925 \'cd\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (f. 40r) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u926 \'ce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 40v-42r) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u927 \'cf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (f. 42r-v) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u937 \'d9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 42v-47v) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 47v-48r) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u929 \'d1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 48r-51r) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 51r-53v) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 53v-54r) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u927 \'cf\u921 \'c9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (f. 54r-v) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u933 \'d5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 54v-56v) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u934 \'d6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 56v-57r) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (f. 57r-v) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u936 \'d8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; letztes Lemma: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u936 \'d8\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u957 \'ed\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u968 \'f8\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u960 \'f0\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Adler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , IV, S. 854, 7. \endash  (ff. 57v-58r) Glossen zur Milit\u228 \'e4rsprache (Ms. ohne Titel); erstes Lemma: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u967 \'f7\u8055 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dividere exercitum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Adler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , IV, S. <855>, 3; letztes Lemma: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hypercerosis: cum ab altero cornu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. S. 864, 5. \endash  Am Textende Subscriptio (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (f. 58v) leer. \endash  (f. 59r, oberes Viertel) Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge zu den Exzerpten (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  haec legenda post 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); inc. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Achilles\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8150 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u8150 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cratinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u8057 ?\u960 \'f0\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8049 ?,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Adler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , IV, S. 75, 11-12 u. 14-15; des. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Candidus historicus, qui de Leone imperatore agit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u950 \'e6\u969 \'f9, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  vgl. S. 801, 13-14.}

