\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  3. (ff. 64r-71r) <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Angelus Politianus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >, Exzerpte aus den Hesiodscholien des \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Demetrius Triclinius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (zu Opera et dies) mit eigenen lat. Notizen bzw. \u220 \'dcbersetzungen (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ex Glossis in Hesiodum Triclinii.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u958 \'ee\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\u8053 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u950 \'e6\u8051 ?\u964 \'f4\u950 \'e6\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u916 \'c4\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965