\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  4. (ff. 71r-74v) <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Angelus Politianus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >, Exzerpte aus antiken Scholien zu Hesiods Theogonia mit eigenen lat. Notizen bzw. \u220 \'dcbersetzungen (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u919 \'c7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u8057 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); inc. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Continet liber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u8053 ?\u947 \'e3\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8004 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ., vgl. L. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Di Gregorio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Hrsg.), Scholia vetera in Hesiodi Theogoniam, Mailand 1975, S. <1>, 1-2; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang10