\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  5. (ff. 74v-76v) <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Angelus Politianus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >, Exzerpte aus den Hesiodscholien des \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Ioannes Pediasimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (zu Scutum) mit eigenen lat. Notizen bzw. \u220 \'dcbersetzungen (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u914 \'c2\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\u947 \'e3\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u8059 ?\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u8057 ?\u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   getilgt] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u969 \'f9\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u949 \'e5\u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u8057 ?\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u967 \'f7\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u919 \'c7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u8057 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u963 \'f3\u960 \'f0\u8055 ?\u948 \'e4\u945 \'e1,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8023 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u7985 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); erstes Lemma (zu v. 1): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u927 \'cf\u7989 ?\u945 \'e1\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8001 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item magna ut hic. Acuitur quod \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   longum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  eqs., vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Gaisford\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (s. oben, Nr. 2), S. 610, 15-16; letztes Lemma (zu v. 367): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u914 \'c2\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u8057 ?\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u7985 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8061 ?\u948 \'e4\u951 \'e7.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u914 \'c2\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  enim sanguis cum pulvere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. S. 649, 20-21. }

