\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (f. 127r-v) Prologus de appositis in frontibus scholiis (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u952 \'e8\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8150 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u960 \'f0\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), edd. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Laga \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  Steel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , I, S. <9>-13. \endash  (ff. 127v-130v) Introductio (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u8059 ?\u955 \'eb\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u8059 ?(\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u8179 ?)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5(\u963 \'f3\u946 \'e2\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u8179 ?)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang103