\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  6. (ff. 207r-208r) Namen Mari\u228 \'e4 (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u8057 ?\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8165 ?\u8053 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u946 \'e2\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u8057 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u8048 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u8048 ?\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u8059 ?\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plai