\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  19. (ff. 224r-235v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Ioannes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  monachus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   Xiphilinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , In dominicam paralytici (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u8059 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u8016 ?\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u969 \'f9\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Eustratiades\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 468, 18-488; kein Prooemium; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   S. 488, 30 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u946 \'e2\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 !\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u8053 ?\u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \pla