\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  20. (ff. 235v-253r) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Ioannes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  monachus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   Xiphilinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , In dominicam Samaritanae (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u8016 ?\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u969 \'f9\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Eustratiades\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 489-518. Mit erheblichen Textabweichungen gegen\u252 \'fcber der Ausgabe; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8222 \'84\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u961 \'f1\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7956 ?\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u8061 ?\u946 \'e2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \ldblquote  (Ioann. 4, 5-6). \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u967 \'f7\u952 \'e8\u8134 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u925 \'cd\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u8053 ?\u956 \'ec\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u8059 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u8049 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u958 \'ee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u921 \'c9\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'e