\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  21. (ff. 253r-273v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Ioannes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  monachus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   Xiphilinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , In dominicam caeci (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8059 ?\u966 \'f6\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u8016 ?\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u969 \'f9\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Eustratiades\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 519-545. Mit gr\u246 \'f6\u223 \'dferen Textabweichungen gegen\u252 \'fcber der Ausgabe; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\u7984 ?\u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7940 ?\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8005 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u946 \'e2\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u8048 ?\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u94