\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  33. (ff. 412v-424r) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Ioannes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  monachus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   Xiphilinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , In dominicam VIII Matthaei (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8000 ?\u947 \'e3\u948 \'e4\u8057 ?\u8131 ?\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u8016 ?\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u8150 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (f. 413v) Hom. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u949 \'e5\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\u951 \'e7\u954 \'ea\u8060 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u919 \'c7\u961 \'f1\u8061 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u961 \'f1\u8061 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8057 ?\u958 \'ee\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  Davor: (ff. 412v-413v) Prooemium; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u927 \'cf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8050 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u951 \'e7\u948 \'e4\u8057 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u8059 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8000 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7940 ?\u961 \'f1\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u8051 ?\u952 \'e8\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u968 \'f8\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7956 ?\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8050 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8017 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?.}

