\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 1r-329r) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Theodorus Metochites\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Miscellanea philosophica et historica (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u952 \'e8\u8051 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u8061 ?\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u967 \'f7\u8055 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), edd. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 M\u252 \'fcller \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  Kiessling \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), u. a. nach dieser Hs.; teilweise ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hult\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (ff. 1r-5v) Kapitelverzeichnis (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u958 \'ee \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef