\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 51. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 181r-186r) In dominicam ante Christi nativitatem (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u951 \'e7\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 `\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u837 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u8053 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u927 \'cf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u8016 ?\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8150 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7940 ?\u9