\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  10. (ff. 224v-226r) De sancto et magno sabbato atque de proditione et caritate (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u927 \'cf\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 `\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u837 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2\u946 \'e2\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u947 \'e3\u8049 ?\u960 \'f0\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u947 \'e3\u945 \'e1\u960 \'f0\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u8055 ?,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\u8053 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8057 ?\u958 \'ee\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 `\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u837 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u947 \'e3\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\u8057 ?\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 `\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u837 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u947 \'e3\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2\u8049 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 `\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u837