\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  12. (ff. 228v-231v) De sacra synaxi (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u927 \'cf\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u8049 ?\u958 \'ee\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 `\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u837 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u8115 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u8115 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u8061 ?\u966 \'f6\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u949 \'e5\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8050 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f