\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  4. (f. 3r, 26.-35. Z. v. o.) De translationibus episcoporum ex sede in sedem aliam (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8158 ?\u927 \'cf\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u960 \'f0\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8016 ?\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8000 ?\u966 \'f6\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [Ms. \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u8115 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u8057 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8050 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u7984 ?\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u960 \'f0\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u183 \'b7 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u8131 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u8057 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u966 \'f6\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u950 \'e6\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8158 ?\u921 \'c9\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u8055 ?\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u958 \'ee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u963 \'f3\u8053 ?\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8057 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u8055 ?\u963 \'f3\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u958 \'ee\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed(\u8131 ?)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8053 ?\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u947 \'e3\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u967 \'f7\u969 \'f9\u961 \'f1\u8053 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u7984 ?\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u960 \'f0\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vgl. Cod. Vat. gr. 1455, f. 14v. \endash  Es handelt sich um die griech. Version des Kanons 27 der f\u228 \'e4lschlicherweise einer sog. 4. Synode von Karthago (398) zugeschriebenen, gemeinhin lat. \u252 \'fcberlieferten Statuta Ecclesiae antiqua (darin als Kanon 11 gez\u228 \'e4hlt), vgl. J.-P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Migne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Patrologiae cursus completus ..., Series prima [= Patrologia Latina], Bd. 56, Sp. 881 B\endash C und die Editionen von \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ch. Munier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   in: Concilia Galliae a. 314 \endash  a. 506 (Corpus Christianorum, Series Latina 148), Turnhout 1963, S. 168; Concilia Africae a. 345 \endash  a. 525 (ebd. 149), 1974, S. 346. Vgl. auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Fr. Lauchert\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Die Kanones der wichtigsten altkirchlichen Concilien ..., [Bonn 1896] Ndr. Frankfurt a. M. 1961, S. XXVI\endash XXVII, sowie die in CPL 1776 angegebene Literatur. \endash  Eine sp\u228 \'e4tere Fassung des lat. Kanons findet sich im Decretum magistri Gratiani (pars II, causa 7, quaest. 1, can. 37), ed. E. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Friedberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (nach E. L. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Richter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Corpus Iuris Canonici, I, Leipzig \plain \f5\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1879, Sp. 580-581.}

