\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  5. (ff. 3r, 36. Z. v. o.-4v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Stephanus V papa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Epist. ad Basilium imp. (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u966 \'f6\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8049 ?\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u929 \'d1\u8061 ?\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u914 \'c2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u8051 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u8150 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8001 ?\u960 \'f0\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u8055 ?\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\u951 \'e7\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u8054 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8023 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u934 \'d6\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7956 ?\u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u968 \'f8\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u929 \'d1\u8061 ?\u956 \'ec\u8131 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8049 ?\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mansi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , XVI, Sp. 420-425; ed. E. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Caspar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Monumenta Germaniae Historica (MGH), Epistolae VII, 1, Berlin 1928, S. 372-374; ed\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 . V. Grumel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , La lettre du pape \u201 \'c9tienne V \u224 \'e0 l\rquote empereur Basile I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 er\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Sina\u239 \'eft. gr. 1117), in: REB 11 (1953), S. <137>-147; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Jaff\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Reg. 3403. \endash  Im Ms. die in MGH abgedruckte Textfassung. \endash  Vgl. Cod. Vat. gr. 1455, ff. 14v-16r.}

