\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  6. (ff. 4v-5r) De translationibus episcoporum ex sede in sedem aliam (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\u8051 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8055 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8127 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7940 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8005 ?\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8016 ?\u948 \'e4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8005 ?\u955 \'eb\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u947 \'e3(\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u8016 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 (!)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u946 \'e2\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 (\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u950 \'e6\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 ....\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8016 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Textende wegen Wassersch\u228 \'e4den nur unter UV-Licht und nur z. T. zu lesen), vgl. J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Darrouz\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u232 \'e8\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Le trait\u233 \'e9 des transferts. \u201 \'c9dition critique et commentaire, in: REB 42 (1984), S. 153. \endash  Vgl. Cod. Vat. gr. 1455, f. 16v.}

