\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  8. (ff. 8v-13r) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Theodorus Abu-Qurra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Epist. continens fidem orthodoxam missa a beato Thoma patriarcha Hierosolymitano ad haereticos in Armenia (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u8051 ?\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8000 ?\u961 \'f1\u952 \'e8\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8055 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u956 \'ec\u8061 ?\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u956 \'ec\u966 \'f6\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0(\u8049 ?)\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u969 \'f9\u956 \'ec\u8118 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u8049 ?\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24  \u8190 ?\u921 \'c9\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  