\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  49a.(ff. 187v-188r) <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Evagrius Scholasticus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Historia eccl. III 17> (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u958 \'ee\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u948 \'e4\u961 \'f1\u8051 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u7984 ?\u947 \'e3\u965 \'f5\u960 \'f0\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u923 \'cb\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 !\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u927 \'cf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8021 ?\u968 \'f8\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u9