24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8022 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8150 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u964 \'f4\u8053 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u946 \'e2\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\u8049 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8150 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u948 \'e4\u8055 ?\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u183 \'b7 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8022 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u947 \'e3\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u8061 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u7984 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u8166 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u947 \'e3\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (vgl. \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Ioannes Chrysostomus\plain \f