\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 107r-234r) Catena in Ioannem (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u8057 ?\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u961 \'f1\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u969 \'f9\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7941 ?\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u8016 ?\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), CPG IV C 147.1 (Ms. zu den \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Codices singuli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   gez\u228 \'e4hlt und unter eigener Nummer gef\u252 \'fchrt); das Werk ist als Ganzes unediert. \endash  (f. 107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 5. Z. v. o.) Prologus (Ms. ohne Titel); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u8061 ?\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8005 ?\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u960 \'f0\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u8016 ?\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7956 ?\u954 \'ea\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u8166 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u8049 ?\u961 \'f1\u958 \'ee\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Danach erstes Lemma in Rot (Ioann. 1, 1 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7974 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); Komm. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u