\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  3. (ff. 159v-160v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Theodoretus Cyrensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Prologus in Prophetas et editiones* (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u969 \'f9\u961 \'f1\u8053 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u8053 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u948 \'e4\u8057 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7971 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u7984 ?\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u948 \'e4\u8051 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u946 \'e2\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\