\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (f. 2r) <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Maximus Confessor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >, De triginta argenteis Iudae* (Ms. ohne Titel), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Soden\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , I, 1, S. 366; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 F. Hultsch\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Metrologicorum scriptorum reliquiae, I, Leipzig 1864, S. 302, 15-19; vgl. CPG III 7707, 7 sowie zur Verfasserfrage \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 W. Lackner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Ein angebliches Gedicht Maximos\rquote  des Bekenners, in: Byz 44 (1974), S. 196-197; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u958 \'ee\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3\u8059 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u8057 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u961 \'f1\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed(\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u8055 ?\u96