\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  7. (ff. 142r-166v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Aristoteles\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Analytica posteriora (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8182 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  Mit den Text erl\u228 \'e4uternden Zeichnungen und wechselnd dichten Scholien in verschiedenen braunen Tinten; erstes Scholion f. 142r (am oberen Rand): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u919 \'c7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8049 ?\u952 \'e8\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8050 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u8166 ?\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8049 ?\u952 \'e8\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 M. Hayduck\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Hrsg.), Eustratii in analyticorum posteriorum librum secundum commentarium (CAG XXI, 1), Berlin 1907, S. VIII, 29-36; Cod. Vat. gr. 2173, f. 247v (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lilla\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Codices, S. 42); letztes Scholion f. 159v (am linken Rand): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\u7984 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u8048 ?\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8023 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8001 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u961 \'f1\u8053 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u958 \'ee\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  (f. 166v) am Textende: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed.}

