\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  8. (ff. 166v-219v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Aristoteles\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Topica (Ms. ohne Gesamttitel; f. 166v: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8182 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  Vereinzelt mit den Text erl\u228 \'e4uternden Zeichnungen und (besonders auf ff. 166v-167r, 187r-188v vorkommenden) Scholien in verschiedenen braunen Tinten; erstes Scholion f. 166v (am linken Rand; zu Top. 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u8057 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u950 \'e6\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u8048 ?\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\u8053 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u950 \'e6\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8134 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u8057 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , letztes Scholion f. 189r (am rechten Rand) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u8060 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8023 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u964 \'f4\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8049 ?\u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u8049 ?\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u957 \'