\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  9. (ff. 219v-241v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Aristoteles\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sophistici elenchi (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7956 ?\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (f. 219v, am Rand) Exzerpt aus einem anonymen Prooemium; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8182 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u7985 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u8182 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7956 ?\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (identisch in Cod. Vat. gr. 2173, ff. 309v-310r, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lilla\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Codices, S. 43). \endash  Auf ff. 219v-222r mit interlinearen Glossen, erstmals f. 219v (zu Soph. El. 164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  20-21 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8050 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u955 \'eb\u8051 ?\u947 \'e3\u967 \'f7\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u8053 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , letztmals f. 222r (zu Soph. El. 167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  5 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8049 ?\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u8051 ?\u958 \'ee\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8142 ?\u917 \'c5\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u8059 ?\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  An den R\u228 \'e4ndern der ff. 220r-226v einige den Text erl\u228 \'e4uternde Zeichnungen sowie Scholien in wechselnder Dichte, die z. T. von \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ebbesen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , CLCAG VII, 2\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), u. a. nach dieser Hs. ediert worden sind: erstes Scholion f. 220r (am oberen Rand); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u927 \'cf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8050 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u8048 ?\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\u8057 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u947 \'e3\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u