\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. IIr-Vv = alte Paginierung \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1-8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Fragmente aus: <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Maximus Confessor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >, Ambiguorum liber (Ms. ohne Gesamttitel), PG 91, 1032-1417; CPG III u. III A 7705 mit Suppl. (vgl. unten, ff. I\u180 \'b4r-III\u180 \'b4v). \endash  (f. IIr, 1.-21. Z. v. o.) Contemplatio in transformationem amplior (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u8057 ?\u961 \'f1\u966 \'f6\u969 \'f9\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), PG 91, 1160 B 13-D 10. \endash  (f. IIr, 22.-27. Z. v. o.) Contemplatio in Moysen et Eliam (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u969 \'f9\u971 \'fb\u963 \'f3\u8134 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u919 \'c7\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , PG 91, 1161 A 1-7. \endash  (ff. IIv, 1. Z. v. o.-IVr, 9. Z. v. o.) Contemplatio in Melchisedech (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang