\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  5. (ff. 32r-51r) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Gregorius Palamas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Epistula ex Thessalonica missa / \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Gregorius Acindynus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Refutatio epistulae Gregorii Palamae (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u8118 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7971 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u8055 ?\u954 \'ea\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u964 \'f4\u8131 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u8051 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u954 \'ea\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u948 \'e4\u8059 ?\u957 \'ed\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Nadal\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , R\u233 \'e9daction premi\u232 \'e8re (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 250-256 (nur Brieftext), nach dieser Hs.; ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 J. Meyendorff\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Une lettre in\u233 \'e9dite de Gr\u233 \'e9goire Palamas \u224 \'e0 Akindynos, in: \plain \f