\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  6. (ff. 51r-64v) <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Gregorius Acindynus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >, Sermo ad patriarcham Ioannem (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u923 \'cb\u8057 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u8061 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u8049 ?\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u8166 ?\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u969 \'f9\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u8059 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\u958 \'ee\u953 \'e9\u8061 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8005 ?\u960 \'f0\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u8118 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u914 \'c2\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u8048 ?\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u8051 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Uspenskij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 85-92, nach dieser Hs.; ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Nadal Ca\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u241 \'f1\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ellas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Gregorio Akindinos, S. 258-284, nach dieser Hs.; vgl. S. 226 (Nr. 8). \endash  Die Confessio auf f. 64r-v (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Nadal Ca\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u241 \'f1\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ellas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 283-284) im Ms. als eigener Text (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u917 \'c5\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8001 ?\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u954 \'ea\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u948 \'e4\u8059 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) mit der Z\u228 \'e4hlung \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u950 \'e6\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   gekennzeichnet.}

