\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 1r-167r) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Isocrates\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Orationes (Ms. ohne Gesamttitel). \endash  (ff. 1r-7r) Ad Demonicum paraenesis, sive De officiis; or. 1 (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u916 \'c4\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (ff. 7r-9v. 20r-23v) Ad Nicoclem de regnando; or. 2 (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u925 \'cd\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u8051 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (ff. 23v-29v. 10r-12r) Nicocles, sive Auxiliaris; or. 3 (Ms. [f. 23v] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u925 \'cd\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7970 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u967 \'f7\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u962 \'f2)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 12r-19v. 30r-34r) Evagoras; or. 9 (Ms. [f. 12r] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\u8016 ?\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u8057 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (ff. 34r-41r) Busiris; or. 11 (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u