\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u961 \'f1\u8053 ?\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); ff. 91-98 falsch eingebunden (ohne Textverlust), vgl. Hinweise zur richtigen Textabfolge von <I. Hardt> auf ff. 91v, 93v, 94v, 95v, 97v. \endash  (ff. 101v-139v) Panathenaicus; or. 12 (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (ff. 139v-167r) Panegyricus; or. 4 (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u923 \'cb\u8057 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). }

