f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u8049 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. princ. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Heisenberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. <93>-96, nach dieser Hs. \endash  (f. 372r-v) Kap. 11 (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Heisenberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 96-97. \endash  (ff. 372v-373v) Kap. 13 (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u947 \'e3\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u958 \'ee\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7940 ?\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8064 ?\u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang103