\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 1r-6r) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Cosmas Hierosolymitanus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Canon in nativitatem Domini (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u8060 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7941 ?\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7972 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u8051 ?\u952 \'e8\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u8055 ?\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8118 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u967 \'f7\u8055 ?\u948 \'e4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8053 ?\u957 \'ed\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8222 \'84\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u8054 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7974 ?\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8005 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u8131 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \ldblquote \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u961 \'f1\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8001 ?\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u