\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 31r-35r) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Theophanes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Graptus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  > / \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Ioannes Damascenus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Canon in annuntiationem B. M. V. (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed(\u8054 ?)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u964 \'f4(\u8055 ?\u8179 ?)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u8060 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u8016 ?\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u8057 ?\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u8055 ?\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u967 \'f7\u8055 ?\u948 \'e4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u955 \'eb\u966 \'f6\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2(\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8222 \'84\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u8055 ?\u958 \'ee\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8057 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \ldblquote  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u967 \'f7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u951 \'e7\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8096 ?\u948 \'e4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8050 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u951 \'e7\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8096 ?\u948 \'e4\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u8055 ?\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u969 \'f9\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u916 \'c4\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , edd. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Christ \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  Paranikas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 236-242, u. a. nach dieser Hs. (als ein Werk allein des Theophanes Graptus). Zur Aufteilung vgl. H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stevenson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , L\rquote hymnographie de l\rquote \u233 \'e9glise greque, in: Revue des questions historiques 20 (1876), S. 525 (Anm. 1). \endash  (ff. 31r-33v) von \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Theophanes Graptus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   stammender Teil (Oden 1-7), edd. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Christ \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  Paranikas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 236-240, 95. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Paraphrase (zur 1. Ode); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8143 ?\u937 \'d9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8051 ?\u963 \'f3\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u8051 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u959 \'ef\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u916 \'c4\u945 \'e1\u965 \'f5\u8054 ?\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Komm. (zur 1. Ode\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u80