33\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7957 ?\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 A. Delatte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u201 \'c9tudes sur la litt\u233 \'e9rature pythagoricienne (Bibl. de l\rquote \u201 \'c9cole des Hautes \u201 \'c9tudes, Sciences hist. et philol. 217), Paris 1915, S. 184. \endash  Derselbe Text in Cod. Vatop. 9, f. 8v, vgl.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  Lamberz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Vatopedi I, S. 57.}

