\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 1r-108r) Scholien zu Hippocrates: \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Damascius philosophus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Expositio in aphorismos Hippocratis* (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u917 \'c5\u961 \'f1\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u921 \'c9\u960 \'f0\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u916 \'c4\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u8057 ?\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dietz \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 236-544, u. a. nach dieser Hs.; zur Autorfrage vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Magdelaine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).}

