\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  11. (ff. 305v-306v) Drei Erotapokriseis zum Alten Testament (Ms. ohne Titel). \endash  (ff. 305v-306r) 1. Erotapokrisis; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u961 \'f1\u8061 ?\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u183 \'b7 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u950 \'e6\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u8049 ?\u970 \'fa\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u8150 ?\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u7985 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u952 \'e8\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u8017 ?\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  (f. 306r) 2. Erotapokrisis; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u961 \'f1\u8061 ?\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u183 \'b7 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u7985 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u954 \'ea\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u7985 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'