\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 154r-177v. 177A\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 178r-196v. 197r. 198r-199r. 200r. 200C\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Exzerpte aus antiken griech. und lat. Autoren (Ms. \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Rerum inlustrium disputationes scriptas paratas fuisse a Protagora, qu\u281 \'ea n\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  unc communiri appellantur loci\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). Die Exzerpte in verschiedenen braunen Tinten geschrieben, z. T. in zwei Spalten und h\u228 \'e4ufig durchgestrichen. \endash  (f. 154r) erstes Exzerpt: \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Plutarchus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Consolatio ad Apollonium (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Plut.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): 1, 1 p. 102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 A\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u927 \'cf\u8016 ?\u948 \'e4\u8050 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u8048 ?\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u7985 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8017 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8051 ?\u968 \'f8\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , edd. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 W. R. Paton \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  I. Wegehaupt, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Plutarchi Moralia, I, Leipzig 1925, S. 208, 13-17. \endash  (f. 200C\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) letztes Exzerpt: <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Aristoteles\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >, De generatione animalium (Ms. ohne Titel): 751\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  24-27 \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8050 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u8059 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u950 \'e6\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\u8049 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7988 ?\u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   }

