\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (f. 201r) Plato (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Platonis ap\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ud\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Long\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )). Erstes Exzerpt: Kap. 29, 1 \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u937 \'d9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8020 ?\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u8118 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u7984 ?\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rhys Roberts\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 116, 17-19\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  (f. 201v) leer. \endash  (f. 202r) Thucydides (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Thucydidis apud Longinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (f. 202v) leer. \endash  (f. 203r) Demosthenes (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Demosthenis apud Longinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (f. 203v) leer. \endash  (f. 204r) unbekannte Autoren (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incertorum auctorum apud Longinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (ff. 204v-205r) Homerus (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Homeri apud Longinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (f. 205v) leer. \endash  (f. 206r) Hesiodus (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hesiodi apud Longinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (f. 206v) leer. \endash  (f. 207r) Xenophon (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Xenophontis apud Longinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). Letztes Exzerpt: Kap. 4, 4 \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8050 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u7970 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u954 \'ea\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rhys Roberts\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 50, 22-23. 
