\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 228r-233v) Exzerpte aus: \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Basilius Caesariensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Epist. ad Gregorium; epist. 2 (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u969 \'f9\u947 \'e3\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), PG 32, 224-233; ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 S. Y. Rudberg, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u201 \'c9tudes sur la tradition manuscrite de saint Basile, Lund 1953, S. 156-168; ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Y. Courtonne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Saint Basile, Lettres, I, Paris 1957, S. 5-13; CPG II 2900\~(2) mit Suppl. \endash  Drei\u223 \'dfig kurze Exzerpte (numeriert von \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   bis \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  30\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) in zwei Spalten: links griech. Text, rechts lat. \u220 \'dcbersetzung. \endash  Vor dem eigentlichen Textbeginn Titelblatt (f. 227r) mit der Aufschrift: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u914 \'c2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Darunter: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Aphorismi Magni Basilij cum interpretatione latina extracti ex epist\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ol\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a p\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  rim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  anct\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  i Basiliij ad S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  anctu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  m Gregorium Theologum in qua agitur de vita in solitudine agenda. Latina interpretatio est G\plain \f4\i\lang1024\fs24 ulielmi Budei, et respondet exemplari gr\u281 \'eace excusso, cum quo collata, et recognita est. Godefridus Tilmannus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
