\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (f. 228r) Erstes Exzerpt: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rudberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 156, 8-11 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u947 \'e3\u8060 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7939 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8050 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u8182 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u8118 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u8059 ?\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u965 \'f5\u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u966 \'f6\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u7984 ?\u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u8059 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7968 ?\u948 \'e4\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u8053 ?\u952 \'e8\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Lat. \u220 \'dcbersetzung dazu: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Interpretatio. Equidem scribere non sustineo prae pudore quae in hoc recessu interdiu noctuque agito\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   eqs. \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  derelicto potui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (f. 233v) letztes Exzerpt: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rudberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 167, 174-168, 177 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 (!)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\u8127 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u945 \'e1\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u8060 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u