v) leer. \endash  (ff. 278r-281v) Secunda atque omnium efficacissima adlocutio postmeridiana ad Iovem Regem (Ms. [in der braunen Schreibtinte] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u916 \'c4\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 !\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u961 \'f1\u8053 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in litura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u8051 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u916 \'c4\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [danach in Rot] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u916 \'c4\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 !\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u963 \'f3\u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Alexandre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 168-182. \endash  (ff. 282r-287r) Adlocutio vespertina ad deos (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u917 \'c5\u963 \'f3\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u963 \'f3\u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Alexandre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 184-202; f. 285v leer ohne Textverlust. \endash  (f. 287v) leer. \endash  (ff. 288r-293r) Hymni XXVII ad deos (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8158 ?\u933 \'d5\u956 \'ec\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [!] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u955 \'eb\u8053 ?\u952 \'e8\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Alexandre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 202-226.}

