\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  5. (ff. 293v-294r) <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Angelus Politianus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >, In laudem cardinalis Mantuani (gemeint ist Francesco Gonzaga), lat. Ode aus \u8222 \'84Orfeo\ldblquote  (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Braccii Ugolini sub persona Orphei in laudem cardinalis Mantuae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): 13 sapphische Strophen; inc. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  O meos longum modulata lusus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (a. c. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quos amor primam docuit iuventam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   eqs.; des. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  conscia mater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 I. Del Lungo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Prose volgari inedite e poesie latine e greche edite e inedite di Angelo Ambrogini Poliziano, Florenz 1867 (Ndr. Hildesheim\endash New York 1976); S. <257>-259; ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 F. Bausi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Poesie di Angelo Poliziano (Classici italiani), Turin 2006, S. 270-274; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 I. Ma\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u239 \'ef\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 er\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Les manuscrits d\rquote Ange Politien. Catalogue descriptif, Genf 1965, S. 191 (Anm. 2). }

