\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 1r-19r) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Nicomachus Gerasenus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Introductionis arithmeticae liber I (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u925 \'cd\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u8049 ?\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u915 \'c3\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u965 \'f5\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u969 \'f9\u947 \'e3\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u952 \'e8\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8059 ?\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8182 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hoche\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), u. a. nach dieser Hs.; ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Spadagu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). Mit den Text erl\u228 \'e4uternden Zeichnungen (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ill\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (f. 1r) am oberen Rand in Rot: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u969 \'f9\u8049 ?\u9