\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (f. 51r-v) <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Hieronymus Aleander\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\~(?), Carmen morale (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u967 \'f7\u965 \'f5\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8004 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8001 ?\u948 \'e4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u956 \'ec\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u7985 ?\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u961 \'f1\u956 \'ec\u8057 ?\u950 \'e6\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u914 \'c2\u959 \'ef\u8059 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u953 \'e9\u8061 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8150 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u963 \'f3\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u961 \'f1\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7970 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u953 \'e9\u8049 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u8059 ?\u966 \'f6\u951 \'e7,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8021 ?\u952 \'e8\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8057 ?\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (f. 52r) Schematische Erl\u228 \'e4uterung zum Carmen morale f. 51r-v. \endash  Vgl. Codd. Vat. gr. 1898, ff. 17r-18r, und 1902, ff. 87v-88r (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Canart\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Codices, S. 561, 592-593); vgl. auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 M. L. Agati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Giovanni Onorio da Maglie, copista greco (1535-1563) (Bollettino dei Classici, Suppl. 20), <Rom> 2001, S. 282 (Anm. 18). }

