\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2. (ff. 6r-84v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Aelius Aristides\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Or. Panathenaica (Ms. ohne Titel), edd. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lenz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Behr (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 7-137. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Mit wechselnd dichten, von erster Hand stammenden Scholien und interlinearen Glossen, die teilweise von \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 G. Dindorf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Aristides, III, Leipzig 1829, S. <1>-343, u. a. nach dieser Hs. ediert worden sind. Mit Verweiszeichen jeweils \u252 \'fcber dem kommentierten Wort. Die sp\u228 \'e4ter erg\u228 \'e4nzten Seiten (ff. 6r-v, 13r-14v, 19r-v; vgl. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  L\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ohne Scholien. \endash  (f. 7r) erstes Scholion (zu \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lenz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Behr, S. 8, 14 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7940 ?\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u8048 ?\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7940 ?\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u919 \'c7\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8050 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u8048 ?\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7990 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u951 \'e7\u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8049 ?,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u948 \'e4\u8055 ?\u948 \'e4\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8050 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7941 ?\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dindorf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 9, 7-17. \endash  (f. 84v) letztes Scholion (zu \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lenz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Behr, S. 137, 14 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8051 ?\u960 \'f0\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8150 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8021 ?\u966 \'f6\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u7985 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u952 \'e8\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u952 \'e8\u8053 ?\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8051 ?\u960 \'f0\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7972 ?\u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  Am Textende: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8057 ?\u958 \'ee\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u8183 ?.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   }

