\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  3. (ff. 85r-91v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Aelius Aristides\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Prolegomena zur or. ad Platonem pro quattuor viris (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u8057 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u8050 ?\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8165 ?\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u963 \'f3\u8049 ?\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lenz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Prolegomena, S. 127-150; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8037 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8134 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8059 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8033 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8054 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u952 \'e8\u8051 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u8166 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8050 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed.}

