\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  4. (ff. 91v-143r) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Aelius Aristides\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , De rhetorica I (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u955 \'eb\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8165 ?\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), edd. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lenz \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  Behr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 145-240. Mit sp\u228 \'e4rlichen, von erster Hand stammenden Scholien und interlinearen Glossen, die teilweise von \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dindorf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Aristides, III, S. 356-432, u. a. nach dieser Hs. ediert worden sind. In der Regel mit Verweiszeichen \u252 \'fcber dem kommentierten Wort. Die sp\u228 \'e4ter erg\u228 \'e4nzten Seiten (ff. 100r-102v, 105r-107v, 132r-v, 139r-v; vgl. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  L\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ohne Scholien. \endash  (f. 91v) erstes Scholion (zu \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lenz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Behr, S. 145, 4 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u927 \'cf\u7990 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8005 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 );\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u959 \'ef\u8055 ?\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7956 ?\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7984 ?\u948 \'e4\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u8061 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8000 ?\u966 \'f6\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8150 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u947 \'e3\u8182 ?\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dindorf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 356, 23-357, 5. \endash  (f. 142v) letztes Scholion (zu \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lenz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Behr, S. 240, 2 \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8005 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u7990 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u919 \'c7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8059 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8222 \'84\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8005 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u7990 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \ldblquote  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8222 \'84\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8182 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8022 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \ldblquote  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

