\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  3. (ff. 68r-73r) Glossarium Latinograecum (Ms. ohne Titel). Lat. Vokabeln in alphabetischer Reihenfolge (A\endash V); abwechselnd lat. und griech. Zeilen. \endash  Textbeginn: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Absum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  abes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  abstineo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   eqs.; darunter: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7940 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u8051 ?\u967 \'f7\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  Textende: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vulnero\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vibro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  voco\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  id\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  em\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); darunter: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8061 ?\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 (!),\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u8182 ?,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u8182 ?.}

