\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 4. (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ff. 73v-74r) Gebet f\u252 \'fcr die Kirche mit Nennung von Papst Eugen <IV.> und des Kardinallegaten Giuliano <Cesarini> (Ms. ohne Titel); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u934 \'d6\u8059 ?\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u958 \'ee\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u8059 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8050 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u8050 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u8061 ?\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u952 \'e8\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7940 ?\u956 \'ec\u969 \'f9\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des. mut.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u8059 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u946 \'e2\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7989 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8118 ?\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  Dazu interlineare lat. \u220 \'dcbersetzung (\u252 \'fcber den ersten drei griech. Zeilen jedes Wort in der gel\u228 \'e4ufigen griech. Abk\u252 \'fcrzung): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Custodi Domine Iesu Christe Deus noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et Salvator clemens sanctam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  catholicam ecclesiam immaculatam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   eqs.; des. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Domine omnipotens et legatum apostolic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  e sedis servum tuum Iulianum, ut in omnibus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  }

