\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  20. (f. 111r. 113C\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [quer zu lesen, s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  L\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ]) <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Demetrius Hyaleas Constantinopolitanus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >, Supplik an die Basler Konzilsv\u228 \'e4ter (Ms. ohne Titel), Ausgabe durch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 K. Hajd\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u250 \'fa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   in Vorbereitung. Griech. Text mit interlinearer lat. \u220 \'dcbersetzung; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u8166 ?\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8001 ?\u961 \'f1\u8182 ?,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u954 \'ea\u8182 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u8051 ?\u947 \'e3\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u8050 ?\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u956 \'ec\u8182 ?\u9