\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  22. (ff. 112r-113r) Lat.-griech. Glossen, \u252 \'fcberwiegend philosophisch-theologischen Inhalts (Ms. ohne Titel): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Oracio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\u8053 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  propositio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cathegorica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  consequencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  antecedens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u8057 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  consequens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Darunter einige weitere griech. W\u246 \'f6rter (ohne lat. Entsprechung). }

