\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  23. (f. 114r) Kanon 28 des Konzils von Chalkedon (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u936 \'d8\u8134 ?\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u954 \'ea\u951 \'e7\u948 \'e4\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u8057 ?\u948 \'e4\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u966 \'f6(\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u951 \'e7\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Joannou\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Fonti I, 1, S. 90, 15-93, 3. Mit interlinerarer lat. \u220 \'dcbersetzung (anderslautend als der von \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Joannou\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , a. O., edierte lat. Text): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ubique sanctorum patrum decreta secuti et nuper lectum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  eqs. \endash  Am Textende der Zusatz: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u8055 ?\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7956 ?\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u946 \'e2\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u945