\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (f. IIr-v) Fragmente aus: <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Ioannes Damascenus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >, Expositio fidei (Ms. ohne Titel), PG 94, 789-1228; ed\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 . B. Kotter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Die Schriften des Johannes von Damaskos, II (PTS 12), Berlin 1973; CPG III u. III A 8043 mit Suppl.; vgl. unten f. I\u180 \'b4r-v. \endash  (f. IIr, 1.-22. Z. v. o.) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Kotter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 115, 76 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8004 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ]\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u8150 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u954 \'ea\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7984 ?\u948 \'e4\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\u8057 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... S. 116, 98 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5 \u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (f. IIr, 23.-33. Z. v. o.) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Kotter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 116, 2 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8158 ?\u927 \'cf\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8050 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8022 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7957 ?\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8016 ?\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... S. 116, 12 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8033 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8005 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u8051 ?\u947 \'e3\u8131 ?\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7940 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\la