\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1. (ff. 1r-2r) Glossae difficiles sermonis de sancto spiritu (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8159 ?\u937 \'d9\u948 \'e4\u8051 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f5\lang1033\fs24 jj\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f5\lang1033\fs24 JJ\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u8051 ?\u958 \'ee\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f5\lang1033\fs24 ~\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f5\lang1033\fs24 JJ\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f5\lang1033\fs24 ~\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8150 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u8048 ?\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f5\lang1033\fs24 jj\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u8061 ?\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f5\lang1033\fs24 jj\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7990 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u955 \'eb\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u952 \'e8\u8049 ?\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u950 \'e6\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u8051 ?\u958 \'ee\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7971 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u948 \'e4\u945 \'e1\u8057 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [!]); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u915 \'c3\u8051 ?\u947 \'e3\u951 \'e7\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u947 \'e3\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u8182 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7940 ?\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  Die (nicht alphabetisch geordneten) Glossen sind als Flie\u223 \'dftext \u252 \'fcber die ganze Breite der Seite geschrieben; der Beginn eines neuen Lemmas wird durch einen Doppelpunkt in der schwarzbraunen Schreibtinte und den roten Anfangsbuchstaben des Lemmas markiert. }

