\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2. (ff. 37v-39r) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Ioannes VIII papa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Epist. ad Photium patr. CP (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7960 ?\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8052 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7992 ?\u969 \'f9\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2 \u934 \'d6\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8061 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u960 \'f0\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mansi,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   XVII, Sp. 524-525; Monumenta Germaniae Historica (MGH), Epistolae Karolini aevi V (Epistolarum Tomus VII), Berlin 1928, S. 226-228 (Nr. 258*); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Jaff\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Reg. 3369. \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hergenr\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Photius, II, S. 541-542.}

