\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  3. (f. 39r-v) De assumptione Beatae Mariae Virginis (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   <\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u968 \'f8\u8061 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  > \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8005 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8048 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24  \u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u8049 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u8049 ?\u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8118 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8016 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2\u8051 ?\u946 \'e2\u951 \'e7\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  Derselbe Text z. B. in Cod. Athous Iberon 92, f. 33r, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 P. Soterudes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8190 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u921 \'c9\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u959 \'