\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  4. (ff. 39v-42r) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Marcus Eugenicus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Epist. ad Georgium presbyterum Methonensem contra ritus Ecclesiae Romanae (Ms.\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24  \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ? \u7937 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7960 ?\u966 \'f6\u8051 ?\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u946 \'e2\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u915 \'c3\u949 \'e5\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8061 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dr\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u228 \'e4\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 seke, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Marcus Eugenicus (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 108-112; ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Petit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Documents (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 470-474 (= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ., Marci Eugenici \u8230 \'85 opera anti-unionistica, S. 162-166); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   S. 474, 21 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7956 ?\u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u968 \'f8\u945 \'e1.}

