\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  5. (f. 42r-v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Marcus Eugenicus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Stichera in s. Gregorium Palamam (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u967 \'f7\u951 \'e7\u961 \'f1\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7941 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u915 \'c3\u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\u960 \'f0\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8118 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f5\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ? \u7937 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7960 ?\u966 \'f6\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8143 ?\u919 \'c7\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u927 \'cf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u958 \'ee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8017 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u968 \'f8\u8055 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u962 \'f2).\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  Dieselben Stichera in Cod. Cosinitzae 192, f. 140v, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 K. G. Mamones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u8049 ?\u961 \'f1\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'