\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  6. (ff. 42v-44v) Demonstratio ex sanctis patribus canonica, quomodo veteris Romae Christiani a Graecis avulsi apostolica exciderint traditione (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7944 ?\u960 \'f0\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u958 \'ee\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7937 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8053 ?,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7985 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8118 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8172 ?\u8061 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u958 \'ee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f