\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  8. (ff. 49v-50v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Marcus Eugenicus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Capita syllogistica adversus Latinos de spiritus sancti ex solo patre processione (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ? \u7937 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7960 ?\u966 \'f6\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u966 \'f6\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2 \u945 \'e1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7985 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u8051 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u923 \'cb\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Petit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Documents (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. <368>-415 (= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ders.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Marci Eugenici \u8230 \'85 opera anti-unionistica, S. <60>-107). \endash  Exzerpt, das acht Kapitel (gez\u228 \'e4hlt \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   bis \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u951 \'e7\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) umfa\u223 \'dft: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\u7984 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8103 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u8049 ?\u960 \'f0\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u965 \'f5\u7985 ?\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8059 ?\u964 \'f4\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8050 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 413 (app. crit.). Danach: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u183 \'b7\u8190 ?\u919 \'c7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u8053 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u965 \'f5\u7985 ?\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 413, 6-414, 33. \endash  (ff. 50v-51r) texterl\u228 \'e4uternde Schemata. \endash  (f. 51v) leer. \endash  Vgl. unten ff. 290r-303v, 476v-477v.}

