\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  9. (ff. 52r-61v) Acta synodi Photianae a. 879/880 (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7960 ?\u954 \'ea \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u958 \'ee\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7937 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7937 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u951 \'e7\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u8057 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7956 ?\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8050 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8021 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 G. Beveregius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Beveridge), \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   sive Pandectae canonum ss. Apostolorum ..., II, Oxford 1672, S. 293-305 (Text im Ms. erheblich abweichend). \endash  Im Ms. eine Kurzfassung der Akten, die auch in Cod. Vat. gr. 1724, ff. 184r-194v (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 C. Gianelli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Codices Vaticani graeci. Codices 1684-1744, Vatikanstadt 1961, S. 102-103 [ausf\u252 \'fchrliche Beschreibung mit Initien]), Cod. Vat. gr. 1937, ff. 1r-35r (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Canart\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Codices, S. 710-711), Cod. Archivii S. Petri B 141, ff. 36r-64r (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 P. Canart\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Catalogue des manuscrits grecs de l\rquote Archivio di San Pietro [StT 246], Vatikanstadt 1966, S. 32-33) \u252 \'fcberliefert ist.
