\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  12. (ff. 143v-146v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Theophanes Imbrius hieromonachus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Epist. ad Ioannem VIII Palaeologum imp. (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u969 \'f9\plain \f5\lang1033\fs24 `\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u837 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u946 \'e2\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8150 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7992 ?\u969 \'f9\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u8131 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\plain \f5\lang1033\fs24 `\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u837 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u947 \'e3\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u8052 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u8049 ?\u967 \'f7\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7985 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u8049 ?\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u946 \'e2\u8059 ?\u950 \'e6\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u8053 ?\u963 \'f3\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7996 ?\u956 \'ec\u946 \'e2\u961 \'f1\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Am Rand: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u959 \'ef\u8055 ?\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u8053 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u966 \'f6\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8020 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7938 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u7990 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u960 \'f0\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u8057 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8118 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u952 \'e8\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7990 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8000 ?\u961 \'f1\u952 \'e8\u8057 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u958 \'ee\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Derselbe Text in Cod. Athous Iberon 381, ff. 59r-69r, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lambros\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Catalogue (s. I. Teil, Nr. 1), S. 104 (Cod. Nr. 4501). \endash  Vgl. PLP IV, Nr. 7617; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Demetrakopulos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 105-106; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dr\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u228 \'e4\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 seke\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Kircheneinigungsversuch (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 574; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Krumbacher\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 117 (Nr. 5).}

