\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  22. (ff. 165r-196r) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Matthaeus Blastares\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Contra Latinos (Ms.\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24  \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u914 \'c2\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8142 ?\u913 \'c1\u961 \'f1\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8050 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u7985 ?\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u956 \'ec\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u967 \'f7\u955 \'eb\u8059 ?\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u8053 ?\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8021 ?\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u958 \'ee\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8000 ?\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u952 \'e8\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8057 ?\u958 \'ee\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u966 \'f6\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8118 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u8166 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u948 \'e4\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ed. (nur kurze Exzerpte) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dositheus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   v. Jerusalem, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8057 ?\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Jassy 1692, S. 439-441 (mir nicht zug\u228 \'e4nglich; zitiert nach \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Paschos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [s. unten], S. 89). \endash  An den R\u228 \'e4ndern die Namen der zitierten Autoren und Werke (h\u228 \'e4ufig abgek\u252 \'fcrzt). \endash  Zum Werk vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 P. B. Paschos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u927 \'cf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u8150 ?\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u914 \'c2\u955 \'eb\u8049 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u956 \'ec\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7956 ?\u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8158 ?\u921 \'c9\u948 \'e4\u961 \'f1\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u8053 ?\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u7989 ?\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   183), Thessalonike 1978, S. 87-90 (mit Nennung weiterer Hss., die diesen Text \u252 \'fcberliefern).}

