\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  23. (ff. 196r-203v, 16. Z. v. o.) <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Matthaeus Blastares\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >, De azymis (Ms.\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24  \u928 \'d0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u950 \'e6\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u917 \'c5\u958 \'ee\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7938 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7988 ?\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u923 \'cb\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u950 \'e6\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u8166 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u967 \'f7\u8051 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u8150 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7988 ?\u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8059 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\u958 \'ee\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u955 \'eb\u965 \'f5\u952 \'e8\u8057 ?\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Zum Werk vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Paschos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (s. oben, Nr. 22), S. 90-92; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hergenr\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Photius, III, S. 852 (mit Anm. 32).}

