24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u8059 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u960 \'f0\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8150 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u8150 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8039 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u948 \'e4\u8061 ?\u955 \'eb\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u8059 ?\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u955 \'eb\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u968 \'f8\u8053 ?\u966 \'f6\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8051 ?\u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u955 \'eb\u8059 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\u8051 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\u965 \'f5\u960 \'f0\u8051 ?\u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  Zum Wer