\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  26. (ff. 230v-231r) De azymis (Ms. ohne Titel; danach: \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8009 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u8061 ?\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8033 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u946 \'e2\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8005 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u8166 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u8048 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8005 ?\u955 \'eb\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u963 \'f3\u8131 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8049 ?\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u950 \'e6\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u8055 ?\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7956 ?\u957 \'ed\u950 \'e6\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8003 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   }

