u8048 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  (f. 301v) am oberen Rand Scholion zu Kap. 28 (Ms. ohne Titel); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\u8059 ?\u964 \'f4\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f2\super\lang1032\fs24 \u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u8049 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8016 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u967 \'f7\u8052 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8005 ?\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  (f. 303v) am Textende erl\u228 \'e4uternde Zeichnung in der braunen Schreibtinte (= das untere Schema bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Petit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Documents, S. 405). \endash  Vgl. ff. 49v-50v, 476v-477v.}

