\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  37. (ff. 304r-305v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Marcus Eugenicus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Commentarius in precem ad Iesum (Ms.\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24  \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u966 \'f6\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 `\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u837 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u8115 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u951 \'e7\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 `\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u837 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8165 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7972 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u8059 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7992 ?\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8050 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u965 \'f5\plain \f