\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  38. (f. 305v) <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Gregorius Nyssenus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >, De opificio hominis (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7960 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 `\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u837 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u958 \'ee\u945 \'e1\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u914 \'c2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u966 \'f6\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u946 \'e2\u-7396 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8023 ? \u7969 ? \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u8053 ?\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u8051 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7984 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u8049 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7972 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u8051 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u8057 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u960 \'f0\u8055 ?\u950 \'e6\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), PG 44, 124-256; CPG II 3154 mit Suppl. \endash  Exzerpt: PG 44, 208 B 1-7 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u8048 ?\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u7985 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u946 \'e2\u961 