\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (f. 444r, 7.-13. Z. v. o.) Erstes Exzerpt: \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Dionysius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Areopagita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  *>, De divinis nominibus (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u916 \'c4\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u956 \'ec\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u8059 ?\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , PG 3, 980 D 4-981 A 4; ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 B. R. Suchla\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Corpus Dionysiacum, I: Pseudo-Dionysius Areopagita. De divinis nominibus (PTS 33), Berlin\endash New York 1990, S. 229, 6-10; CPG III 6602 mit Suppl. \endash  (f. 464r) letztes Exzerpt: <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Matthaeus Blastares\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >, Collectio alphabetica (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8055 ?\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8051 ?\u956 \'ec\u960 \'f0\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8189 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u7985 ?\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8000 ?\u961 \'f1\u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u8057 ?\u958 \'ee\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8055 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , edd.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  Rhalles \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  Potles\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   VI, S. 74, 22-23. \endash  (f. 445v) am seitlichen und unteren Rand: langes Scholion zu \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Cyrillus Alexandrinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Thesaurus de sancta et consubstantiali trinitate (vgl. CPG III u. III A 5215); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u967 \'f7\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u8061 ?\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8016 ?\u967 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8033 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u7985 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u923 \'cb\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8150 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u8053 ?\u966 \'f6\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8021 ?\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u958 \'ee\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7956 ?\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8166 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7941 ?\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u965 \'f5\u7985 ?\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u8051 ?\u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7941 ?\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u8059 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7952 ?\plain \f2\