8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8023 ? \u7969 ? \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u8053 ?\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u951 \'e7\u961 \'f1\u8059 ?\u964 \'f4\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u8134 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  Kurze Exzerpte, wohl aus verschiedenen Quellen; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8158 ?\u917 \'c5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8165 ?\u8134 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7989 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u951 \'e7\u952 \'e8\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?