\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  7. (ff. 476v-477v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Marcus Eugenicus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Capita syllogistica adversus Latinos de spiritus sancti ex solo patre processione (Ms.\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24  \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7937 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7960 ?\u966 \'f6\u8051 ?\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u8049 ?\u961 \'f1\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u966 \'f6\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Petit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Documents (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. <368>-415 (= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ders.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Marci Eugenici \u8230 \'85 opera anti-unionistica, S. <60>-107). \endash  Exzerpt, das acht Kapitel (ohne Z\u228 \'e4hlung) umfa\u223 \'dft: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\u7984 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8103 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u8049 ?\u960 \'f0\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u965 \'f5\u7985 ?\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8059 ?\u964 \'f4\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8050 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7940 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 413 (app. crit.). Danach: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u919 \'c7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u8053 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032