\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1. (ff. 1r-57v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Euripides\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , <Phoenissae> (Ms. ohne Titel); f. 1r: am oberen Rand \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  336 seors\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ., darunter lat. Inhaltsangabe (vgl. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , b, c). \endash  (f. 1r) erstes Scholion (zu v. 4 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8057 ?\u952 \'e8\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u8115 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8057 ?\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u957 \'ed\u8055 ?\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u8049 ?\u948 \'e4\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7974 ?\u955 \'eb\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u8134 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8053 ?\u957 \'ed\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u934 \'d6\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u8055 ?\u954 \'ea\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dindorf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , III, S. 34, 8-9. \endash  (f. 57r) letztes Scholion (zu v. 1754 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u946 \'e2\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u948 \'e4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8023 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u8049 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u8050 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u947 \'e3\u8060 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u948 \'e4\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u949 \'e5\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u916 \'c4\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dindorf,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   III, S. 405, 26-406, 2. \endash  Dar\u252 \'fcber hinaus mehrere l\u228 \'e4ngere, nicht identifizierte Randscholien, z. B. auf f. 39r (zu v. 1189 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u183 \'b7 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u946 \'e2\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u954 \'ea\u956 \'ec\u8053 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u183 \'b7 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8050 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8022 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u8059 ?\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u8048 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u961 \'f1\u965 \'f5\u952 \'e8\u961 \'f1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8001 ?\u961 \'f1\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u8051 ?\u966 \'f6\u951 \'e7,\plain \f1\lang1