?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u8049 ?\u950 \'e6\u8131 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Auf f. 113v (zu v. 164 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8032 ?\u948 \'e4\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u8059 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u8057 ?\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8005 ?\u956 \'ec\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u958 \'ee\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8021 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u183 \'b7 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8032 ?\u948 \'e4\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f