\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 157r-176v) zu den Phoenissae (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u967 \'f7\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u934 \'d6\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u8055 ?\u963 \'f3\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\u8016 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u960 \'f0\u8055 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Arsenius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ff. <141v>-199r (im Druck falsch foliiert: \u8222 \'84299\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \ldblquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dindorf,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   III, S. <30>-409. \endash  (ff. 177r-192v) zu Medea (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u967 \'f7\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u951 \'e7\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\u8016 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u960 \'f0\u8055 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Arsenius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ff. <199v>-225v; ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dindorf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , IV, S. <5>-84. Auf f. 192v nach dem Scholientext die Bemerkung: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u8049 ?\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u916 \'c4\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8001 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8050 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u916 \'c4\u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  (ff. 193r-230v) zu Hippolytus (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u967 \'f7\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u921 \'c9\u960 \'f0\u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\u8016 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u960 \'f0\u8055 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Arsenius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ff. <226v>-274v; ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dindorf,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   I, S. <73>-199. \endash  (ff. 230A\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -230B\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer. \endash  (ff. 231r-237r) zu Andromache (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u967 \'f7\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u957 \'ed\u948 \'e4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u8049 ?\u967 \'f7\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\u8016 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u960 \'f0\u8055 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Arsenius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ff. 283r-293v; ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dindorf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , IV, S. <122>-209. Auf f. 231r am oberen Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  336 seors\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (vgl. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , b). \endash  (f. 237v) leer. \endash  (ff. 238r-242v) zu Alcestis (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u967 \'f7\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7948 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u954 \'ea\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\u8016 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u960 \'f0\u8055 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Arsenius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ff. 275r-283r; ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dindorf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , IV, S. <88>-119.}

