\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... 477, 16 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Prooemium s. unten, Nr. 18 (f. 74r-v). \endash  Vgl. Cod.graec. 196, Nr. 19.
