\f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8060 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u956 \'ec\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u915 \'c3\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8050 ?\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7990 ?\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8059 ?\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u8150 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Vgl. Cod.graec. 196, Nr. 41; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hennephof\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 288-289\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 .}

