\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  27. (f. 35r, 10.-21. Z. v. o.) <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Ioannes monachus Xiphilinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >, In dominicam V Matthaei (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Nur Prooemium; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u8118 ?\u962 \'f2,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u8055 ?,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\u8059 ?\u950 \'e6\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8053 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u8016 ?\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\u8059 ?\u950 \'e6\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\u8057 ?\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u8150 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u952 \'e8\u8053 ?\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef(\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8017 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u963 \'f3\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u8053 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed(\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \~\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u8150 ?\u957 \'ed\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u961 \'f1\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u955 \'eb\u952 \'e8\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u8061 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u915 \'c3\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5(\u963 \'f3\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed).\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Homilie s. unten, Nr. 31 (ff. 77r-88r). \endash  Vgl. Cod.graec. 196, Nr. 28.}

