\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  28. (ff. 35r, 22. Z. v. o.-36r) <\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Ioannes monachus Xiphilinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >, In transfigurationem Christi (6. August) (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u966 \'f6\u8061 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u8016 ?\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u8115 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u8115 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u8057 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u8150 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). Nur Prooemium; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u917 \'c5\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u8150 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8038 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u8061 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7940 ?\u952 \'e8\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u948 \'e4\u8053 ?\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u8053 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u968 \'f8\u8061 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u8016 ?\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u952 \'e8\u8051 ?(\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2),\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8021 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7956 ?\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8165 ?\u8134 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u903 ?\u964 \'f4\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u961 \'f1\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u946 \'e2\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u8051 ?\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u8049 ?\u954 \'ea\u969 \'f9\u946 \'e2\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u969 \'f9\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u966 \'f6\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u8183 ?.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Homilie s. unten, Nr. 36 (ff. 129r-138v).}

