\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1. (ff. 421r-425v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Ioannes Damascenus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Carmen in Christi nativitatem (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u8060 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7984 ?\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u946 \'e2\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u947 \'e3\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u967 \'f7\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u8055 ?\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u969 \'f9\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u916 \'c4\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8023 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u967 \'f7\u8054 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), PG 96, 817-825; edd. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Christ \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  Paranikas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 205-209, u. a. nach dieser Hs.
