\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  An den R\u228 \'e4ndern dichte Scholien in kleinerer Schrift von anderer Hand (vgl. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , II. Teil). \endash  (f. 421r) erstes Scholion; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u969 \'f9\u963 \'f3\u8051 ?\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3(\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u958 \'ee\u8057 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7971 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u952 \'e8\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  (f. 424v) letztes Scholion; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u960 \'f0\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u8118 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u951 \'e7(\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ?) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u8053 ?\u964 \'f4(\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u8051 ?\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8021 ?\u956 \'ec\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u945 \'e1\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u958 \'ee\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u8055 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  (ff. 422r-423r) interlineare Glossen in Rot: erste Glosse (zu \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Christ \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Paranikas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 206, 36 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u7984 ?\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u8182 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , letzte Glosse (zu S. 206, 57 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u8115 ?)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1.}

